# ROOFCAT: only one star in the air at first; each catnip allows one more,
# up to three. Holding B keeps throwing, as fast as the limit allows.
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
cheat clear_foes
cheat cam 0
wait 20
press B 1
press B 1
press B 1
expect stars == 1
wait 40
hold B 24
expect stars == 1
wait 40
cheat power 1
hold B 24
expect stars == 2
wait 40
cheat power 2
hold B 24
expect stars == 3
